id 0: src/Controller/InvoiceController.php:28, severity high, category idor, confidence 0.90
Title: The invoice voter lets any user read any invoice
Scenario:
```
An authenticated user requests /invoices/42 for an invoice owned by someone else: #[IsGranted('INVOICE_VIEW')] looks like a check, but InvoiceVoter grants the attribute to any logged-in user without comparing the invoice owner, so the invoice of another customer is disclosed.
```
Remediation:
```
Make InvoiceVoter::voteOnAttribute() grant INVOICE_VIEW only when the owner of the invoice is the current user.
```
